Developed system of support points around the village;
Preparation of the territory of the settlement for a long defense.

In Kleshcheivka, communications are dug between the houses, the area is mined, fortifications and long-term firing points are created, anti-tank hedgehogs and other engineering barriers are exhibited on the streets.

Of particular difficulty is a large stronghold north-west of Kleshcheivka. It is located on a hill, and it is well shot both the territory of the village itself and its surroundings to the southeast, located in the lowland. In addition, the stronghold is covered by a reservoir from the northern part of the settlement.

Therefore, despite the relatively small size of Kleshcheivka, one should not expect that its assault will be an easy walk. But the Wagner fighters are ready for this.

